WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:14.323
Big slime monsters attack.

2
00:00:14.324 --> 00:00:20.017
A slime turtle knocks into the Gummy Guards.

3
00:00:20.018 --> 00:00:24.067
The kids hold on to each other.

4
00:00:24.068 --> 00:00:29.986
"Stay with me," Paul says.

5
00:00:29.987 --> 00:00:36.445
Suddenly slime snakes wrap around Paul!

6
00:00:36.446 --> 00:00:42.230
"Prince, Princess, run!" he cries.

7
00:00:42.231 --> 00:01:03.061
The kids run away from the fighting.

8
00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:07.368
Jane looks at the castle.

9
00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:11.655
"We need to wake the queen.

10
00:01:11.656 --> 00:01:15.124
There's a ladder by that tower."

11
00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:21.124
"We can sneak inside," Pip says.

12
00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:25.582
"That silly duke won't know."

13
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:29.679
At the doors the duke twirls and sings.

14
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:32.842
"The boy is rude. The girl is mean.

15
00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:39.764
Now they'll sleep just like the queen!"

16
00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:47.379
Jane nods. "I hope this plan isn't wrong."

17
00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:58.113
The kids sneak to the tower.

18
00:01:58.114 --> 00:02:05.044
They hurry up the ladder.

19
00:02:05.045 --> 00:02:10.842
Bam! A hurt monster crashes into the ladder.

20
00:02:10.843 --> 00:02:12.674
The ladder shakes.

21
00:02:12.675 --> 00:02:15.929
"Ahh!" Jane cries.

22
00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:29.345
"Huh?" The duke looks up. "Get them!"

23
00:02:29.346 --> 00:02:36.929
An ugly slime bird flies at the kids.

24
00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:45.886
They jump in a window as it swoops.

25
00:02:45.887 --> 00:02:50.667
"That was close!" Pip says.

26
00:02:50.668 --> 00:02:54.636
"Come on." Jane grabs Pip's hand.

27
00:02:54.637 --> 00:03:02.838
"We need to find June and the queen!"

